WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.419
when working with Word documents the may

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:05.720
be occasions where you need to change a

00:00:03.419 --> 00:00:07.950
specific word or words within a document

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:09.540
if the document there's only one page

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:11.250
long that can be quite straightforward

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:14.490
and you can just go through and replace

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:16.500
each word manually however when working

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:18.270
with large documents it may be a case

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:21.539
that this is unrealistic and

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:23.340
time-consuming within word there is a

00:00:21.539 --> 00:00:24.660
feature called find and replace which

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:26.670
will allow you to search for specific

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:30.029
words and then replace them with another

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:32.430
word in this example letter that I have

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:35.219
on the screen I'm going to find the word

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:37.829
information and replace that with the

00:00:35.219 --> 00:00:40.500
word theatre I know there are several

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:42.660
instances of the word information so to

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:46.200
access the Feiner replace tool I simply

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:49.610
go to the edit menu button scroll down

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:53.180
to select find and then select replace

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:55.489
this brings up the find arias dialog box

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:58.710
so the word I'm looking for is

00:00:55.489 --> 00:01:01.020
information and it will highlight every

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:05.189
instance of the word information and I'm

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:08.010
gonna change that with theatre so once

00:01:05.189 --> 00:01:09.869
I'm happy if I select replace all that

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:13.439
will automatically replace every

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:16.760
instance of the word information with

00:01:13.439 --> 00:01:16.760
the word theater